  badgeEnglish: "LEVEL 8 - 5-OBJECT CHALLENGE"
  titleSpanish: "\u00a1Cinco Residuos Distintos!"
  titleEnglish: "Five Different Waste Items!"
  descriptionSpanish: "\u00a1Ya casi eres un guardi\u00e1n ecol\u00f3gico! Clasifica 5 residuos diferentes en sus basureros correspondientes sin equivocarte."
  descriptionEnglish: "You're almost an eco guardian! Sort 5 different waste items into their matching bins without making a mistake."
  stepsSpanish: "1. Pl\u00e1tano (Verde), Envoltura (Gris), Jeringa (Rojo).\n2. Botella de pl\u00e1stico (Azul) y Botella de vidrio (Amarillo).\n3. \u00a1Un solo error reiniciar\u00e1 el nivel!"
  stepsEnglish: "1. Banana (Green), Wrapper (Grey), Syringe (Red).\n2. Plastic bottle (Blue) and Glass bottle (Yellow).\n3. A single mistake will restart the level!"
